This repository holds code under more than one licence.

Gumbo itself is free to use and its code stays EON Studios' (all rights reserved). That
covers the plugin (Gumbo/Eon_JSFX/Instruments/Gumbo_ReaKit.jsfx), the gb_* includes in
Gumbo/ReaKit/ and the Gumbo scripts in Gumbo/Scripts/ (the "Gumbo ..." actions and the
gumbo_*.lua files). The terms are in Gumbo/Gumbo_LICENSE.md, which also carries the
notices of the published work SPACE, CHORUS and the EQ are built on.

The EON Free Licence 1.0 (LICENSE-EON-FREE.md beside this file: free to use in any work,
not for sale or redistribution) covers the parts Gumbo shares with EON Studios' free
ReaKit FX: Gumbo/ReaKit/qz_engine.jsfx-inc (Quezy's filter engine), the three
"ReaKit FX - ..." scripts in Gumbo/Scripts/ (the dock behind the action "Gumbo - Dock")
and the icons in Gumbo/Data/.

The MIT licence below covers the other includes in Gumbo/ReaKit/ (the ReaKit library:
knobs, buttons, meters, rk_* and the other shared files). Parts ported from other
authors' code keep those authors' notices, in the files themselves: Quezy's engine after
Justin Johnson's ReEQ (MIT), rk_svf after Justin Johnson (MIT), rk_svf_match after Yuriy
Ivantsov (MIT), and the curve in rk_sat after Michael Gruhn (LOSER).

It does NOT cover the sounds. The Gumbo GM sounds in GM/ are made from MuseScore General
(MIT), whose own licence file is beside them
(GM/Data/EON_Gumbo/Library/MuseScore General/MuseScore_General_License.md).
THIRD_PARTY_CREDITS.md lists everyone whose work Gumbo is built on or measured against.

